**Overview of website**

ICICI Direct, the retail trading and investment platform of ICICI Securities, offers a seamless 3-in-1 account combining banking, trading, and demat services. It provides access to equities, derivatives, mutual funds, IPOs, ETFs, commodities, fixed deposits, bonds, insurance, wealth management, NRI services, and stock market research through a single integrated account. With strong research support, advanced trading tools, and advisory services, it caters to retail investors, active traders, and long-term wealth builders. The platform focuses on trust, technology and transparency to enable investors to make informed financial decisions.

